# Requirements Library: ERP Implementation — Overview

## Structure
30+ requirements organized by module category, each with:
- Functional requirements (business capabilities)
- Technical requirements (system specifications)
- Complexity rating (Low/Medium/High)
- Business criticality (Medium/High/Critical)

## Financial Modules (12 requirements)

### General Ledger (GL)
**Complexity**: High | **Criticality**: Critical
- Multi-entity consolidation with elimination entries
- Multi-currency with real-time exchange rates
- Period-close automation with configurable checklist
- Intercompany processing and reconciliation
- Budget-to-actual with variance analysis
- Drill-down from summary to transaction
- REST API for external reporting
- Bulk import (100K+ records/batch)
- Role-based security (50+ permissions)
- Bank feed integration for auto-reconciliation
- Immutable audit trail

### Accounts Payable (AP)
**Complexity**: Medium | **Criticality**: Critical
- Three-way matching with tolerance configuration
- OCR-based invoice scanning
- Vendor self-service portal
- Multi-bank payment batch processing
- Early payment discount tracking
- 1099/VAT/GST tax reporting automation
- EDI integration for vendor submission
- Mobile approval workflow
- Duplicate invoice detection
- AI-based GL coding from historical patterns

### Accounts Receivable (AR)
**Complexity**: Medium | **Criticality**: High
- Automated invoicing with multi-channel delivery
- Dunning management with escalation paths
- AI-powered cash application matching
- Credit management with automated scoring
- Dispute resolution workflow
- Recurring billing for subscriptions
- Customer payment portal
- Payment gateway integration
- Lockbox automation
- CRM integration for 360° customer view

### Cash Management
**Complexity**: Medium | **Criticality**: High
- Real-time bank balance visibility
- ML-based cash flow forecasting
- Automated bank reconciliation
- Investment/borrowing tracking
- FX exposure monitoring
- Treasury workstation integration

## Supply Chain Modules (8 requirements)

### Procurement
**Complexity**: High | **Criticality**: High
- Strategic sourcing with supplier scorecards
- Purchase requisition with approval matrices
- Catalog-based procurement for indirect spend
- Supplier qualification workflows
- Contract management with milestones
- Sustainable procurement tracking

### Inventory Management
**Complexity**: High | **Criticality**: Critical
- Multi-location inventory visibility
- ABC/XYZ classification and cycle counting
- Safety stock optimization with demand forecasting
- Lot/serial tracking for traceability
- Cross-docking and transfer orders
- RFID/barcode warehouse integration

## Reporting & Analytics (10 requirements)

### Financial Reporting
**Complexity**: Medium | **Criticality**: High
- Pre-built report library (P&L, BS, CF)
- Scheduled automated distribution
- Ad-hoc drag-and-drop report builder
- Regulatory templates (GAAP, IFRS)
- Consolidated multi-entity reporting

### Operational Analytics
**Complexity**: High | **Criticality**: Medium
- Executive KPI dashboard
- Departmental spend analysis with drill-down
- Supplier performance dashboards
- Working capital optimization
- Predictive revenue forecasting
